category: Science
requires: cygwin libgcc1 libstdc++6 zlib0
sdesc: "Low complexity and tandem repeat masker for biosequences"
ldesc: "tantan identifies simple regions / low complexity / tandem repeats in
DNA or protein sequences.  Its main aim is to prevent false homology
predictions between sequences.  Simple repeats often align strongly to
each other, causing false homology predictions."

